{"id":"657554","name":"排骨粉条炖酸菜","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/657554/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酸菜","amount":"500g"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"80g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨切块，酸菜洗一洗。","img":"images/657554/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨焯水。","img":"images/657554/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"花椒大料小火煸炒出香味。","img":"images/657554/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入排骨炒出多余的水分。","img":"images/657554/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒香以后，放一勺酱油，再放开水，倒入砂锅。","img":"images/657554/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一点底油，炒一下酸菜。","img":"images/657554/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再把排骨汤倒入酸菜里，大火煮开以后，倒入砂锅炖。","img":"images/657554/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"小火炖半个小时。","img":"images/657554/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入泡一下的粉丝。","img":"images/657554/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"粉丝根据情况，炖二十分钟左右。","img":"images/657554/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放一点盐调味。","img":"images/657554/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}